        "TileImage": "$($repository 714e1c8f-c547-4e87-88ed-9a847bc523f2).Image",
        "Description": "A contract has been issued, and you have been cleared to engage. You have 5 targets, Benny Potter and  Montgomery Statham are members of an operation run by arms dealer Abdul Suleiman. Abdul is here to negotiate with Theo Braddock, Founder of the Blackwing Agency. Intel informs us that Braddock is here to aquire large amounts of weapons and ammunition from Dubai, the set of weapons were marked illegal for sale in the U.S. The final target is Erica Stenet Braddock Assistant. Good Luck 47.",
